Thank you — we value the partnership too, which is why I want to be candid. We've qualified a second supplier whose quote is +9%, and I have leadership asking why we'd pay more than that for the same spec. I understand resin and freight pressures are real, but our data shows resin indices have eased from their peak, and our volumes give you stable, predictable utilization worth protecting.

